=== INTENDED BEHAVIOR ===
Quickselect on multisets. Partition picks a pivot from a non-empty multiset and splits the remaining elements into those on either side of the pivot. QuickSelect uses it to find the element of a given rank, returning it along with the elements that come before and after it in sorted order.

